# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Copied into the export as-is, like `_headers`.

# English lives at the root, not under a prefix — `/vs-linear`, not
# `/en/vs-linear`. Nothing on the site links to `/en/…`, but readers and
# crawlers guess it once they've seen `/zh/…` and `/fr/…`, and it would
# otherwise 404. Send them to the page they meant.
/en / 301
/en/* /:splat 301
